{"reviewId": "10259823_8d1ujH6d4", "review": {"abstract": "当然，历史同样显示，经济长周期和中周期衰退共同出现之时，也是大宗资源品价格崩溃之时。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "03 “色即是空” 世界经济的共生模式与国际资源品价格调节新机制", "chapterUid": 8, "content": "- 2000–2008：长周期衰退 + 中周期强复苏 → 供需打架，大宗商品大牛市（符合书中案例）\n​\n- 2026现在：长周期已经从衰退走到萧条；中周期只是断断续续的弱修复，企业不愿意大胆扩产、没有爆发式需求起来。\n​\n- 风险点（书中后半句）：一旦长周期萧条叠加中周期再次进入衰退，商品就容易大跌崩盘，这就是现在很多人提防的情景。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "range": "5880-5922", "createTime": 1792586410, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 8, "reviewId": "10259823_8d1ujH6d4", "userVid": 10259823, "topics": [], "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "03 “色即是空” 世界经济的共生模式与国际资源品价格调节新机制", "author": {"userVid": 10259823, "name": "珍珠鹿", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0017-1brP1Fna5HircHAa928dz10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "珍珠鹿", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-10", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 1, "likes": [{"userVid": 933699510, "name": "每天阅读一小时", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0027-G60lko24hSLC59C6hFwpy10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "每天阅读一小时", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": ""}], "commentsCount": 2, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "现在就是萧条期了，中周期也不行！", "reviewId": "1